  "details": "This has bothered me forever. Icons on the right side of the gesture menu have text layered underneath the icons they can collide with. which means that big icons can easily cover the text and obscure what they are supposed to say.\n\nI suggest the layering order change slightly to reduce this from happening.\n\nEven better, give us options to move the text more easily up and down, as there isn't any easy richtext formatting supported for vrchat menus that allows that currently.",
